   "evidence": "Lines 119-128 are the whole `FunLike`/`ext` block: `instance : FunLike ... coe := toFun`, `@[simp] theorem toFun_eq_coe (W : GaugeLink V G) : W.toFun = W := (rfl)`, `@[ext] theorem ext`. Grep for `coe_mk` and `mk_apply` in the file returns nothing. Module docstring line 31-33: \"any later analytic construction of the link from a gauge potential only has to supply them\".",
